            _context.Products.Remove(product);
            _context.SaveChanges();
        }
    }
}
```

### 2.  **Use a Service Layer**

Create a service class that acts as an intermediary between your POCO objects and the repository layer. This layer provides a more abstracted interface for data access and business logic.

